r","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows November to December came in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids. In 2025 that pair came in at 35% of normal, and October to November at 55%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 24% of normal on the middle of the grids, and February to March at 34%.</p>"}
